            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Interlock 0.1.3 Private Alpha

- Adds **Interlock → Check for Updates…** and signed automatic update checks.
- Repairs stale launch-agent definitions left by earlier packaged builds.
- Keeps mutable data under `~/Library/Application Support/Interlock`.
- Includes MT5 terminal auto-relaunch and expired-session sign-in recovery.
]]></description>
